OL,3,GNEWSAMy physical deformity left me
OL,4,Afeeling invisible - but one surgeon saw
OL,5,Ame
OL,6,
OL,7,FAs a teenager at school, Charlie Clarke
OL,8,F"felt awful" in her uniform, with a
OL,9,Fphysical deformity leaving her so
OL,10,Fself-conscious that she hid from her
OL,11,Fclassmates.
OL,13,FAt home, she wrapped her dressing gown
OL,14,Ftight around her chest, hoping it would
OL,15,Fconceal her condition - and didn't even
OL,16,Ftell her parents about it.
OL,18,FNow 26, Charlie has lived with pectus
OL,19,Fexcavatum - a congenital chest wall
OL,20,Fcondition that can make the chest
OL,21,Fappear sunken or hollow - for years.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
