OL,3,GNEWSAMy physical deformity left me
OL,4,Afeeling invisible - but one surgeon saw
OL,5,Ame
OL,6,
OL,7,FAs she awaits surgical treatment, she
OL,8,Fsaid the emotional and physical effects
OL,9,Fof the condition were "unimaginable and
OL,10,Funignorable".
